      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    cash_flows = [20000, 30000, 50000, 60000]\n    initial_investment = -100000\n    guess_rate = 0.10\n    tolerance = 1e-6\n    max_iterations = 1000\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    def npv(rate):\n        return initial_investment + sum(\n            cash_flow / ((1 + rate) ** period)\n            for period, cash_flow in enumerate(cash_flows, start=1)\n        )\n\n    def npv_derivative(rate):\n        return sum(\n            -period * cash_flow / ((1 + rate) ** (period + 1))\n            for period, cash_flow in enumerate(cash_flows, start=1)\n        )\n\n    rate = guess_rate\n    for _ in range(max_iterations):\n        current_npv = npv(rate)\n\n        if abs(current_npv) < tolerance:\n            break\n\n        rate -= current_npv / npv_derivative(rate)\n\n    # Return the MWRR as a percentage rounded to two decimal places\n    answer = round(rate * 100, 2)\n    return answer\n```",
